{
 "id": "ui-palette-light",
 "priority": "P2",
 "title": "UI VIDEO U1 light: command palette open (Shift-Cmd-P) and close (Escape) by real HID keys, 10 times, filmed at the display rate",
 "why": "UI VIDEO (STATUS 4269): the palette must show complete in the next refresh after the key and leave in one frame, with no blank list, flash or half-drawn frame. The VM judge (scripts/cmux-next/switch-frames/judge_switch.py) reads the movie: OLD = before the key, TARGET = settled after it.",
